ord holder and had won the AAU Championship in 1910 and 1911.  However, neither was present in Stockholm."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In their absence, the Swedes dominated the hop, step, and jump.  They swept the first three places and garnered six of the top 12 places.  " [:a {:href "/athletes/76264"} "Gustaf “Topsy” Lindblom"] ", in his only Olympic appearance ever, had the two longest jumps with his first efforts in the qualifying, and won the gold medal easily over teammate " [:a {:href "/athletes/76026"} "Georg Åberg"] ", who had won the bronze medal in the " [:a {:href "/results/56789"} "long jump"] "."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Distance"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/76264"} "Topsy Lindblom"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "14.76"] [:td {} "14.76 (1)"] [:td {} "14.35 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/76026"} "Georg Åberg"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "14.51"] [:td {} "14.51 (2)"] [:td {} "14.03 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/76040"} "Erik Almlöf"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "14.17"] [:td {} "14.17 (3)"] [:td {} "14.10 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]]